164 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Dear Hiring Team\054\nThis role caught my attention because of the problem space\056 Helping employees be productive from day one\054 across onboarding\054 permissions\054 equipment\054 and support\054 are workflows that most companies struggle to handle\056 There\047s real room to get them right\056\nI\047ve done this kind of work before\056 At Remuner I joined as the first and only designer with no existing practice\054 no components\054 no documented patterns\056 I built the discipline from scratch while shipping product\072 multi\055step approval workflows\054 role\055based permission systems\054 data mapping flows\056 The design system came in parallel\054 not after\056 At Abacum I was the first designer on the integrations squad\054 taking a back\055office tool used only by the implementation team and turning it into something enterprise finance teams could use on their own\056\nWhat I find most relevant about this role is that it\047s not just about shipping features\056 It\047s about setting the foundations\072 the patterns\054 the standards\054 the way design works inside a team that doesn\047t have that yet\056 That\047s work I find genuinely motivating\054 and I have direct experience doing it\056\nThe most relevant case is at https\072\057\057manel\055leiva\056com\057cases\057dataset\055manager\056 Happy to walk through both that and the Remuner work in more detail\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 163 0 R
     /Pg 158 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

